  "configuration_id": "config_039",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 with multiprofile is strong for RNA-only (~0.65 accuracy), image-only is weak (~0.21-0.23), and the only multimodal result, config_038, is the best so far at 0.7207 accuracy and 0.6815 F1 using transformer aggregation and concat fusion. The key uncertainty is whether concat fusion is specifically responsible for the multimodal gain or whether weighted fusion could improve or clarify the fusion design. config_039 changes only fusion from concat to weighted while keeping the otherwise promising RNA encoder, image encoder, profile setting, and aggregation fixed, isolating the effect of fusion. This is the best next experiment because it is a minimal one-factor extension of the top configuration, has high expected value, and avoids changing multiple design choices under the limited budget."
}

